#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.res_config_settings_view_form_inherit_l10n_ve_exchange
msgid ""
"Applies only to CUSTOMER invoices and credit notes. The exchange difference "
"left when reconciling a foreign-currency customer invoice is documented as a"
" real Debit Note (gain) or Credit Note (loss), instead of a generic entry."
msgstr ""
"Aplica solo a facturas y notas de crédito de CLIENTE. El diferencial "
"cambiario que quede al conciliar una factura de cliente en moneda extranjera"
" se documenta como Nota de Débito (ganancia) o Nota de Crédito (pérdida) "
"real, en vez de un asiento genérico."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_journal__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_company__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
msgid ""
"Applies only to CUSTOMER invoices and credit notes. When enabled, the "
"exchange difference left open when reconciling a foreign-currency customer "
"invoice is NOT absorbed by Odoo's automatic entry -- instead, it is "
"documented with a real Debit Note (gain) or Credit Note (loss), issued "
"against the original invoice and reconciled against the remaining residual."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activado, el diferencial cambiario que queda abierto al "
"conciliar una factura/documento en moneda extranjera NO es absorbido por el "
"asiento automático de Odoo -- en su lugar, se documenta con una Nota de "
"Débito (ganancia) o Nota de Crédito (pérdida) real, emitida contra la "
"factura original y conciliada contra el residual restante."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot determine the accounting account for this exchange difference "
"Debit/Credit Note line: neither the company's %(account_field)s nor the note"
" product's own %(product_field)s is configured. Set at least one of them "
"(Accounting Settings > Default Accounts, or the product's Income/Expense "
"account) before reconciling foreign-currency invoices with the exchange "
"difference Debit/Credit Note mode enabled."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo determinar la cuenta contable para esta línea de Nota de "
"Débito/Crédito de diferencial cambiario: no está configurada ni la "
"%(account_field)s de la compañía ni la %(product_field)s propia del "
"producto de la nota. Configure al menos una de las dos (Ajustes Contables >"
" Cuentas por Defecto, o la cuenta de Ingreso/Gasto del producto) antes de "
"conciliar facturas en moneda extranjera con el modo de ND/NC de "
"diferencial cambiario activado."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot number this exchange difference Debit/Credit Note: journal "
"%(journal)s has no dedicated sequence configured for %(kind)s "
"(date=%(date)s). Configure the journal before reconciling foreign-currency "
"invoices with the exchange difference Debit/Credit Note mode enabled."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo numerar esta Nota de Débito/Crédito de diferencial cambiario: "
"el diario %(journal)s no tiene una secuencia dedicada configurada para "
"%(kind)s (fecha=%(date)s). Configure el diario antes de conciliar facturas"
" en moneda extranjera con el modo de ND/NC de diferencial cambiario "
"activado."

