#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure a dedicated 'Refund Sequence' (Credit Note sequence) on journal "
"%(journal)s before reconciling foreign-currency invoices with the exchange "
"difference Debit/Credit Note mode enabled -- a Credit Note must never be "
"numbered with the invoice journal's own sequence."
msgstr ""
"Configure una 'Secuencia de Reembolso' (secuencia de Nota de Crédito) "
"dedicada en el diario %(journal)s antes de conciliar facturas en moneda "
"extranjera con el modo de ND/NC de diferencial cambiario activado -- una "
"Nota de Crédito nunca debe numerarse con la secuencia propia del diario de"
" la factura."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure a dedicated 'Refund Sequence' (Credit Note sequence) on journal "
"%(journal)s before reversing this exchange difference Debit Note -- the "
"reversal must never be numbered with that journal's own main sequence."
msgstr ""
"Configure una 'Secuencia de Reembolso' (secuencia de Nota de Crédito) "
"dedicada en el diario %(journal)s antes de revertir esta Nota de Débito de"
" diferencial cambiario -- la reversión nunca debe numerarse con la "
"secuencia principal propia de ese diario."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure a sale journal with 'Is Debit' enabled and its dedicated Exchange "
"Difference Debit Note sequence assigned before reconciling foreign-currency "
"invoices with the exchange difference Debit/Credit Note mode enabled -- a "
"Debit Note must never be numbered with the invoice journal's own sequence."
msgstr ""
"Configure un diario de venta con 'Es Débito' activado y su secuencia "
"dedicada de Nota de Débito de diferencial cambiario asignada, antes de "
"conciliar facturas en moneda extranjera con el modo de ND/NC de diferencial "
"cambiario activado -- una Nota de Débito nunca debe numerarse con la "
"secuencia propia del diario de la factura."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure a sale journal with 'Is Debit' enabled and its dedicated Exchange "
"Difference Debit Note sequence assigned before reversing this exchange "
"difference Credit Note -- the reversal must never be numbered with the "
"invoice journal's own Credit Note sequence."
msgstr ""
"Configure un diario de venta con 'Es Débito' activado y su secuencia "
"dedicada de Nota de Débito de diferencial cambiario asignada, antes de "
"revertir esta Nota de Crédito de diferencial cambiario -- la reversión "
"nunca debe numerarse con la secuencia propia de Nota de Crédito del diario"
" de la factura."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure the 'Exchange Difference Note Pricelist' (in the company's own "
"currency) in Settings > Binaural Settings before reconciling foreign-"
"currency invoices with the exchange difference Debit/Credit Note mode "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Configure la 'Lista de Precios de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario' (en la "
"moneda propia de la compañía) en Ajustes > Ajustes de Binaural antes de "
"conciliar facturas en moneda extranjera con el modo de ND/NC de "
"diferencial cambiario activado."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure the 'Exchange Difference Note Product' in Settings > Binaural "
"Settings before reconciling foreign-currency invoices with the exchange "
"difference Debit/Credit Note mode enabled."
msgstr ""
"Configure el 'Producto de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario' en Ajustes > "
"Ajustes de Binaural antes de conciliar facturas en moneda extranjera con "
"el modo de ND/NC de diferencial cambiario activado."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Could not find the receivable line on the newly created exchange difference "
"note '%(note)s' -- this should never happen for a posted customer "
"invoice/note."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró la línea por cobrar en la nota de diferencial cambiario "
"recién creada '%(note)s' -- esto nunca debería pasar para una "
"factura/nota de cliente posteada."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_original_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_original_id
msgid ""
"Credit Note that reverses the original exchange difference Debit Note. Only "
"set on automatically generated reversal entries."
msgstr ""
"Nota de Crédito que revierte la Nota de Débito original de diferencial "
"cambiario. Solo se establece en asientos de reversión generados "
"automáticamente."

